5","global_turn_index":271,"locator":"[S15T15]","raw_turn_sha256":"4cd662a8287360452e0fa136e9faa6fc8f7e8017d6ac2c5510de869f42bead4f","rendered_turn_sha256":"b846f6abd94989063ff462adac6e06758c25f0508644bc69369d4f73e919707d","session_date":"2023-08-22","session_datetime":"2023-08-22T11:06:00","session_id":"session_15","session_index":15,"source_sha256":"22c5f44a590f8f6de08898b27f0c1f43e4bcc792b2a5c9b57026a3a086fb8dad","speaker":"Dave","turn_index":15}],"speaker":null,"store_id":"s2","store_snapshot_sha256":"e9b96bcd4e036f4ea4599edb06e9c0527c929442b09efe05d09ea416b8a4469d","text":"Dave: Wow, Tokyo sounds like an incredible experience!\n[S15T5] (dia_id: D15:5)\n\nCalvin: It was an incredible experience, Dave! The city was buzzing with energy and the festival crowd was so lively - it was like fuel for my soul. Look at this photo, that's amazing!\n[Image caption: a photo of a crowd of people sitting on the grass at night]\n[S15T6] (dia_id: D15:6)\n\nDave: Wow, that sounds incredible! What was it like playing at the festival? Must have been an amazing experience.\n[S15T7] (dia_id: D15:7)\n\nCalvin: It was a dream come true, Dave! The festival had buzzing energy and a super upbeat crowd. We all felt connected, it was amazing!\n[S15T8] (dia_id: D15:8)\n\nDave: Sounds like you had a blast! Did any other collaborations come out of that performance? Any upcoming concerts we should know about?\n[S15T9] (dia_id: D15:9)\n\nCalvin: Yeah Dave, someone even noticed my performance and now we're working together, which is wild. My tour ends soon and I'm heading to Boston. Maybe we can meet up then!\n[S15T10] (dia_id: D15:10)\n\nDave: Sounds great! Fill me in on the details when you have them and let's meet up when you're here. Can't wait to hear all about everything!\n[S15T11] (dia_id: D15:11)\n\nCalvin: Of course, Dave can't wait to catch up! I almost forgot, yesterday my friends and I recorded a podcast where we discuss the rapidly evolving rap industry!\n[S15T12] (dia_id: D15:12)\n\