r mutual friend knew we'd be a great fit. Can't wait to show you the final result. Also, check out this project - I love working on it to chill out. How about you? Got any hobbies to help you relax?\n[Image caption: a photo of a shiny orange car with a hood open]\n[S21T3] (dia_id: D21:3)\n\nDave: Wow, Calvin, that car looks great! Working on cars really helps me relax, it's therapeutic to see them come back to life. I've been working on that Ford Mustang I found in a junkyard - it was in bad shape, but I knew it had potential.\n[S21T4] (dia_id: D21:4)\n\nCalvin: Wow, Dave! It's awesome that you can bring things back to life. Do you have any pictures of it looking amazing? I'd love to see how it turned out!\n[S21T5] (dia_id: D21:5)\n\nDave: Hey Calvin, check out this photo! I put in a lot of work restoring it, but the result is awesome. It's so satisfying to bring an old car back to life.\n[Image caption: a photography of a red car parked in a field with other cars]\n[S21T6] (dia_id: D21:6)","text_sha256":"a864e16f80acb360e6c046900588d5912d99767c18876cbddd8a8e2eb810c841","timestamp":"2023-10-04T14:44:00"}],"integrity":{"post_tree_sha256":"e9b96bcd4e036f4ea4599edb06e9c0527c929442b09efe05d09ea416b8a4469d","pre_tree_sha256":"e9b96bcd4e036f4ea4599edb06e9c0527c929442b09efe05d09ea416b8a4469d","store_unchanged":true,"verified":true},"metrics":{"completion_tokens":1208,"filesystem_tool_calls":0,"model_calls":4,"orchestration_calls":4,"prompt_tokens":12661,"provider_request_attempts":4,"provider_rounds":4,"token_usage_available":true,"total_tokens":13869},"model":{"requested_model":"coding","served_models":["qwen3.8:27b"]},"prompt_contract":{"derived_prompt_sha256":"6930d93099ac20b76e881b68cbb63b46e1a0a3e2ff43453db685551c3339a6dc","filesystem_tools_sha256":"98017e74a12c2eec4f0139c484d2d6bd809e4f37a8f96c7f419dc9591563dbfa","orchestration_actions_sha256":"3fa6b1160c2f7f9b2a8b3e232721d4ca78a161abb31af0d4f1f2e307b7354581","paper_prompt_id":"refind-appendix-a-stage1-plus-temporal-